<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Dashboard — NetProject</title>
  <style>
    * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
    body { font-family:Arial,sans-serif; background:#f0f4f8; min-height:100vh; display:flex; flex-direction:column; }
    nav { background:#1a73e8; padding:12px 20px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:16px; flex-shrink:0; }
    .logo { color:white; font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:bold; margin-right:10px; }
    nav a { color:white; text-decoration:none; font-size:0.95rem; padding:4px 8px; border-radius:4px; }
    nav a:hover { background:rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }
    .spacer { flex:1; }
    .user-info { color:#cce0ff; font-size:0.9rem; }
    .logout-btn { background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4); color:white; padding:5px 14px; border-radius:4px; cursor:pointer; font-size:0.9rem; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; }
    .logout-btn:hover { background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25); }
    .page { flex:1; padding:40px 30px; max-width:900px; margin:0 auto; width:100%; }
    h2 { color:#1a73e8; font-size:1.5rem; border-bottom:2px solid #1a73e8; padding-bottom:8px; margin-bottom:8px; }
    .subtitle { color:#555; font-size:0.92rem; margin-bottom:30px; }
    .protected-badge { display:inline-block; background:#e8f5e9; color:#2e7d32; border:1px solid #a5d6a7; border-radius:16px; padding:4px 14px; font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:bold; margin-bottom:24px; }
    h3 { font-size:1rem; color:#333; margin-bottom:12px; margin-top:28px; }
    table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:0.88rem; }
    th { background:#1a73e8; color:white; padding:9px 14px; text-align:left; }
    td { padding:8px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd; vertical-align:top; }
    tr:nth-child(even) td { background:#f5f8ff; }
    .yes { color:#2e7d32; font-weight:bold; }
    .detail { color:#555; font-size:0.83rem; margin-top:2px; }
    .home-link { display:inline-block; margin-top:28px; color:#1a73e8; text-decoration:none; font-size:0.9rem; }
    .home-link:hover { text-decoration:underline; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<nav>
  <span class="logo">NetProject</span>
  <a href="/">Home</a>
  <span class="spacer"></span>
  <span class="user-info">Logged in as <strong><%= username %></strong></span>
  <form method="POST" action="/logout" style="margin:0;">
    <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
    <button type="submit" class="logout-btn">Log Out</button>
  </form>
</nav>

<div class="page">
  <h2>Dashboard</h2>
  <p class="subtitle">This page is protected (only authenticated users can reach it).</p>
  <span class="protected-badge">Session Active: <%= username %></span>

  <h3>Security Features Currently Active on This Session</h3>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Feature</th><th>What Is Happening Right Now</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>HTTPS / TLS</strong></td>
        <td>
          <span class="yes">Active</span>
          <div class="detail">All traffic between your browser and this server is encrypted. GitHub Pages provided this automatically via Let's Encrypt.</div>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Secure Session Cookie</strong></td>
        <td>
          <span class="yes">Active</span>
          <div class="detail">Your session cookie is flagged <code>HttpOnly</code> (JavaScript cannot read it), <code>SameSite=Strict</code> (cross-site requests won't include it), and expires in 1 hour.</div>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>CSRF Token</strong></td>
        <td>
          <span class="yes">Active</span>
          <div class="detail">Every form on this site embeds a hidden token tied to your session. The server rejects any POST that doesn't include a matching token — so another website cannot trick your browser into making requests on your behalf.</div>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Content Security Policy</strong></td>
        <td>
          <span class="yes">Active</span>
          <div class="detail">Helmet sets the <code>Content-Security-Policy</code> HTTP header on every response, blocking the browser from loading any external scripts, stylesheets, or frames.</div>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Rate Limiting</strong></td>
        <td>
          <span class="yes">Active</span>
          <div class="detail">The <code>/login</code> route blocks any IP that sends more than 10 requests within 15 minutes — preventing automated brute-force password guessing.</div>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>bcrypt Password Hashing</strong></td>
        <td>
          <span class="yes">Active</span>
          <div class="detail">Your password was hashed with bcrypt (cost factor 12) before being stored. The database never holds your plain-text password — only a hash that cannot be reversed.</div>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>SQL Injection Protection</strong></td>
        <td>
          <span class="yes">Active</span>
          <div class="detail">Every database query uses parameterized statements (<code>WHERE username = ?</code>). User input is never interpolated directly into a SQL string, so an attacker cannot manipulate the query.</div>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <a class="home-link" href="/">← Back to Networking Concepts</a>
</div>
</body>
</html>